  "title": "Arctic buoy drift observations from the International Arctic Buoy Programme (IABP) - Sea Ice Polar Stereographic North",
  "description": "Daily position, drift velocity, and environmental observations (air temperature, surface temperature, barometric pressure) reported by Arctic drifting buoys from the International Arctic Buoy Programme (IABP), accessed via ERDDAP. Data is produced as two products: the Daily product provides an interactive Leaflet map showing buoy positions and 24-hour drift vectors for a selected date, with optional sea ice concentration and sea sector overlays. The Lifetime product provides exploratory data analysis dashboards summarizing each buoy's full observation history, including drift statistics, climate observations, sea sector transitions, and individual buoy detail pages.",
